  "analysis_summary": "The log set shows normal system activity for an Azure VM (guest agent network traffic, routine Sysmon process‑access events, registry writes from Explorer). However, a critical event was observed where the Windows Security audit log was cleared by the local Administrator account (wardog). Clearing the audit log is a strong indicator of an attempt to hide malicious activity and is therefore the primary abnormal finding. No encoded PowerShell commands or obvious C2 traffic were detected.",
